# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whitelist style: everything in this folder is data/results/tooling
# (~40 GB of imaging data lives here next to the code). Only the entries
# below are tracked; all else — CZI, TIF, results, notes, venv, extras —
# stays on disk but untracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*

# --- tracked: code + tests + workflow scripts + packaging/docs ---
!/src/
!/tests/
!/scripts/
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/.gitignore

# --- plans: default-ignored; a branch tracks a specific plan by negating it ---
# a branch that owns a plan adds this (3 layers: un-exclude dir, exclude contents, re-include the file):
/plans/

# --- never track, anywhere ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

!/plans/
plans/*
!/plans/fit-speedups.md
